# Two shaped shots on hole 1 of the test course with the IIIx app buttons:
# Memo (hard4) picks the shape and Date Book (hard1) does the three swing
# clicks. Start it on the tee view once it's drawn. The drive is a draw (one
# Memo press), the second shot a punch (five presses from normal on an iron),
# both at 95 % power with the snap on time.
# Clicks after each swing start are 120 ms later than the meter times above: on the IIIx the
# meter's clock starts about then, once its first frames show.
0 key-down hard4
80 key-up hard4
1500 snapshot "{out}/s1-aim.png"
2000 key-down hard1
2060 key-up hard1
3070 key-down hard1
3130 key-up hard1
